{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37170","headline":"赠方干先生 · 翁洮","name":"赠方干先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来箕踞任天真，别有诗名出世尘。\n不爱春宫分桂树，欲教天子枉蒲轮。\n城头鼙鼓三声晓，岛外湖山一簇春。\n独向若耶溪上住，谁知不是钓鳌人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁洮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}